  clock: 2  # f131
  nonce: f131  # f131
  message: "Per ADR-0028 (fully landed, Edge.is_resolved at ir.py:399): the polyglot-fixture audit's pass criterion per call site is edge.is_resolved == True with an evidence_type drawn from evidence_types_on_axis(AXIS_INFERENCE_PATHWAY) — NOT membership in a hardcoded *_resolved evidence-type set. The endpoint_shape section of EVIDENCE_TYPES is empty after Phase 4b closure (audit-findings 0008/0012/0014). This unblocks the audit: the property test shape is now stable and language-agnostic, so the audit fixture (WI-pisab-furis Level 2) can land without further axis-vocabulary work."  # f131
